{"root":"ember","ipa":"/ˈɛmbər/","core":"余烬，炭火；指燃烧后留下的炽热灰烬或炭块。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈɛmbər/","zh":"余烬，炭火","phrases":[{"t":"bara api","zh":"炭火"},{"t":"sisa pembakaran","zh":"燃烧后的残余"},{"t":"mengipasi bara","zh":"扇动炭火"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia meniup bara agar api kembali menyala.","zh":"他吹着炭火，好让火焰重新燃起。"},{"t":"Sisa bara itu masih panas di dalam perapian.","zh":"壁炉里的余烬依然滚烫。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"ember","ipa":"/ˈɛmbər/","zh":"余烬，炭火","phrase":{"t":"bara yang membara","zh":"炽热的余烬"},"example":{"t":"Jangan menyentuh bara itu.","zh":"别碰那些炭火。"}},{"w":"membara","ipa":"/məmˈbara/","zh":"燃烧，炽热；形容像炭火一样发红或充满激情。","phrase":{"t":"semangat yang membara","zh":"炽热的精神"},"example":{"t":"Matanya membara karena marah.","zh":"他因愤怒而双眼发红。"}},{"w":"bara","ipa":"/ˈbara/","zh":"炭火，余烬（ember的印尼语同义词）","phrase":{"t":"bara api","zh":"火炭"},"example":{"t":"Bara itu mulai padam.","zh":"炭火开始熄灭了。"}}],"derSlugs":["ember","membara","bara"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T09:02:34.913Z","src":"base"}